Feature: Acceptance - exposed attack surface
  Only ports we intentionally publish may be open on the VM

  Background:
    Given "nmap" is installed

  Scenario: The application port is open
    When I launch an "nmap" attack with:
      """
      nmap --open -p 8080,8081,8090,9000 localhost
      """
    Then the output should contain:
      """
      8090/tcp open
      """
